category: Utils
build-depends: cygport libxcb-randr-devel libxcb-devel libxcb-xinerama-devel perl
sdesc: "Featherweight lemon-scented bar"
ldesc: "lemonbar (formerly known as bar) is a lightweight statusbar based on XCB.
Provides full UTF-8 support, basic formatting, RandR and Xinerama support and
EWMH compliance without wasting your precious memory."
